# Intentionally empty Compose env file. Do not add variables.
# Passed as --env-file by the acceptance stack (project smarthotel-acceptance,
# src/SmartHotel.Web/e2e/global-setup.ts) and the test database (project
# smarthotel-test, TestPostgres.cs), so Compose never reads a developer .env.
